    "show_share": true,
    "description": "New discoveries from stem cell research have raised hope among scientists for breakthrough cures for common diseases ranging from heart disease to diabetes. However, with the new discoveries have come new ethical and regulatory questions, said experts at a symposium co-hosted by NOVA University and the Aga Khan University (AKU) in Lisbon.",
